id: full-power-super-saiyan-back-to-basics
name: Back to Basics
order: 4
slot: trait
# One of these is chosen (the Transformation's row asks).
group: super-saiyan-style-traits
groupLabel: Super Saiyan Style Traits
description: >
  You have no need for those inefficient evolutions of the Super Saiyan form; when properly mastered, the basic Super Saiyan far outclasses them.
text: >
  Back to Basics: You have no need for those inefficient evolutions of the Super Saiyan form; when properly mastered, the basic Super Saiyan far outclasses them.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Access to Super Saiyan 1. Variants do not count as Super Saiyan 1 for this effect.
  (2)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Option effect you chose for the 3rd effect of S-Cells.
  (3)-[1/Round]: While you have 4+ stacks of Battle Born, you may use the Power Up Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver.
  (4)-[Passive]: Depending on your number of Power stacks, gain access to the following effects:
  2+ Power Stacks [Triggered, 1/Round]: When making an Attacking Maneuver, you can add up to 2 Energy Charges to that Attacking Maneuver. After concluding that Attacking Maneuver, lose a number of Battle Born stacks equal to the amount of Energy Charges added by this effect.

---

